WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:06.721
Here's a first look at the new Gaming Lab in FluidEQ. One place to shape the sound of each game.

2
00:00:08.313 --> 00:00:12.553
Add a game, then choose a Gaming profile for its style or title.

3
00:00:17.315 --> 00:00:21.695
Use Try it now to load that game's sound and open its controls.

4
00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:28.523
Shape the Game filter, edit your EQ bands, and see your correction curves.

5
00:00:33.328 --> 00:00:38.618
Browse the gaming presets for each DSP stage, and tune the sound to your setup.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:46.563
Save your tuning as a profile. When a game comes to the front, its sound can follow.

7
00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:56.062
This is a development preview. Follow FluidEQ for updates, and find the current app at fluideq dot com.
